  "title": "Kirby Problem 4.76",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Let X be a closed, oriented, simply connected, smooth 4manifold and fix $k >$ 0. Is there $N \\geq$ 0 such that, for every $n \\geq N$, the natural map $\\pi_{k}(\\operatorname{Diff}^{+}(X\\#_{n}S^{2} \\times S^{2})) \\to \\pi_{k}(\\operatorname{Homeo}^{+}(X\\#_{n}S^{2} \\times S^{2}))$ is surjective?",
